      </div>
      <p>Copilot's dominant star rating (4.24★) is partly an artifact of low complaint exposure (90.3% General reviews, fewest specific complaints) rather than demonstrated quality leadership. Its thumbs-up average (3.48) suggests active users, but per-theme engagement is high across all complaint types (Bug: 7.98, Accuracy: 5.33) — meaning its vocal minority is strongly engaged and frustrated. As enterprise Microsoft 365 integration becomes commoditized, Copilot's advantage from familiarity and bundling may erode, and its accuracy/hallucination weakness (4.6% complaint rate despite suppressed exposure) could surface more prominently. Track its bug and accuracy complaint growth quarter-over-quarter as a leading churn indicator.</p>
